        "basis": "site",
        "note": "Government ART centre (NACO/DSACS lists) and an ICTC for HIV testing in the Department of Microbiology (Room 5, ground floor, New Medicine OPD Block, per a 2015 DSACS list). The Dermatology department is listed by DSACS as an STD clinic. Endocrinology & Metabolism runs diabetes OPDs on weekday mornings, a Paediatric and Adolescent Endocrine Clinic (Monday afternoon), a Diabetes of the Young clinic (Saturday morning) and a gestational diabetes clinic (Friday morning) (schedule last updated Feb 2024). OPD appointments can be booked through the ORS portal. Government ART centre under NACO. NACO's 2021 guidelines say people living with HIV get free diagnostics and free first-, second- and third-line ART at these centres; they don't say whether non-Indian nationals are covered, so call or visit in OPD hours to ask."
