        "note": "ART Clinic (NACO project) under the Department of Medicine, Mon–Fri 09:00–16:00 and Sat 09:00–13:00. ICTC for HIV testing in Microbiology, Room 554, New OPD Building (2015 DSACS list); Dermatology is a DSACS-listed STD clinic. Endocrinology (5th floor, Super Speciality Block, rooms 512–519): new cases Tue and Thu, follow-up diabetic clinic twice a week, paediatric and adolescent clinic on Wednesdays including young-onset diabetes (onset under 25). Dieticians and health educators teach insulin technique and home glucose monitoring; foot-care advice and a foot lab. Government ART centre under NACO. NACO's 2021 guidelines say people living with HIV get free diagnostics and free first-, second- and third-line ART at these centres; they don't say whether non-Indian nationals are covered, so call or visit in OPD hours to ask."
